@startuml
title Health Safety Officer Alert
participant "mqttBroker:MqttBroker" as MqttBroker
participant "mqttClient:MqttClient" as MqttClient
participant "alertController:AlertController" as AlertController
participant "workerHealthModel:WorkerHealthModel" as WorkerHealthModel
participant "baselineCalculator:BaselineCalculator" as BaselineCalculator
participant "alertView:AlertView" as AlertView
participant "alertNotification:AlertNotificationPanel" as AlertNotification
actor HealthSafetyOfficer

MqttBroker -> MqttClient: publishMessage(topic, payload)
note right of MqttBroker
MQTT QoS Level 1 - At least once delivery
end note
MqttClient -> MqttClient: onMessageArrived(topic, message)
note right of MqttClient
Callback triggered by Paho MQTT client library
end note
MqttClient -> MqttClient: parseAlertPayload(payload)
note right of MqttClient
Parses JSON: {workerId:'W12345', type:'RESTING_HR_DEVIATION', currentValue:78, baselineValue:58, deviation:34.5%, timestamp:1643970840000}
end note
MqttClient -> AlertController: handleIncomingAlert(alertData)
AlertController -> WorkerHealthModel: getWorkerById(workerId)
WorkerHealthModel --> AlertController: worker {id:'W12345', name:'John Doe', team:'engineering'}
AlertController -> BaselineCalculator: validateDeviation(workerId, currentValue, alertType)
BaselineCalculator -> WorkerHealthModel: getRestingHrHistory(workerId, days)
WorkerHealthModel --> BaselineCalculator: readings [30-day history, 420 readings]
BaselineCalculator -> BaselineCalculator: calculateBaseline(readings)
note right of BaselineCalculator
Computes: mean=58.2, stdDev=4.1, threshold=66.4 (mean + 2*stdDev)
end note
BaselineCalculator -> BaselineCalculator: assessDeviation(currentValue, baseline)
note right of BaselineCalculator
Current 78 vs threshold 66.4 = SIGNIFICANT deviation
end note
BaselineCalculator --> AlertController: analysis {severity:SIGNIFICANT, percentageDeviation:34.5%, recommendation:"Immediate check-in"}
AlertController -> AlertController: createAlertRecord(worker, alertData, analysis)
AlertController -> WorkerHealthModel: saveAlert(alert)
WorkerHealthModel -> WorkerHealthModel: persistToDatabase(alert)
note right of WorkerHealthModel
Inserts into HEALTH_ALERTS table with status=UNACKNOWLEDGED
end note
WorkerHealthModel --> AlertController: void
AlertController -> AlertView: displayAlert(alert)
note right of AlertView
Runs on JavaFX Application Thread
end note
AlertView -> AlertNotification: showNotification(alert)
AlertNotification -> AlertNotification: buildNotificationContent(alert)
note right of AlertNotification
Creates JavaFX VBox with alert icon, worker name, deviation details
end note
AlertNotification -> AlertNotification: applyUrgencyStyle(severity)
note right of AlertNotification
Applies red border, urgent icon for SIGNIFICANT severity
end note
AlertNotification -> AlertNotification: slideIn(duration: 400ms)
note right of AlertNotification
Animates notification panel from right edge using Platform.runLater
end note
AlertNotification --> AlertView: void
AlertView -> AlertView: updateAlertList(alert)
note right of AlertView
Adds to ObservableList<HealthAlert> bound to TableView
end note
AlertView -> AlertView: playAlertSound(severity)
note right of AlertView
Plays urgent.wav for SIGNIFICANT alerts
end note
AlertView --> AlertController: void
AlertController --> MqttClient: void
MqttClient -> MqttBroker: publishAck(messageId)
note right of MqttClient
MQTT QoS 1 acknowledgment
end note
AlertView --> HealthSafetyOfficer: Visual: Red notification banner | Audio: Urgent alert tone
note right of HealthSafetyOfficer
Shows: ⚠ John Doe - Resting HR elevated 34.5% above baseline (78 vs 58 BPM)
end note
@enduml
